      "writtenOn": "2026-04-25T08:47:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The core hypervisor doesn\u0027t know what is inside `cmd_desc_hva`, so it is up to the driver to define it, it can have something as:\n```\nstruct cmd_request {\n     u8 type; /* Resume, CFGI,...)\n     u8 args[]..\n}\n```\n\nBut no strong opinion, it looks better now with the args passed in registers,",
      "parentUuid": "3287686c_965a3c06",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 9,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "d29fdf5c506e9b2897fe08478af3805aef790285",
